<section id="A2.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.5. </span>Hyperparameter Sensitivity Analysis</h3>

<div id="A2.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We analyze the sensitivity of ADaMoRE to the load balancing coefficient, <math id="A2.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{load}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{load}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the model’s hidden dimension. The results, presented in Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.5. Hyperparameter Sensitivity Analysis ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiments and Analyses ‣ Adaptive Graph Mixture of Residual Experts: Unsupervised Learning on Diverse Graphs with Heterogeneous Specialization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, indicate that our framework is robust within effective operational ranges. As shown in Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.5. Hyperparameter Sensitivity Analysis ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiments and Analyses ‣ Adaptive Graph Mixture of Residual Experts: Unsupervised Learning on Diverse Graphs with Heterogeneous Specialization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>(a), a non-zero load balancing coefficient is essential for good performance, with <math id="A2.SS5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{load}=0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{load}=0.1</annotation></semantics></math> being optimal in our experiments. Figure <a href="#A2.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ B.5. Hyperparameter Sensitivity Analysis ‣ Appendix B Additional Experiments and Analyses ‣ Adaptive Graph Mixture of Residual Experts: Unsupervised Learning on Diverse Graphs with Heterogeneous Specialization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>(b) demonstrates a clear trend where performance progressively improves as the hidden dimension increases from 128 to 1024, suggesting that a larger model capacity is beneficial for learning richer representations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F6" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F6.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.21207v1/lb_coef.png" id="A2.F6.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/299;" width="476" height="299" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F6.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="A2.F6.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Sensitivity to <math id="A2.F6.sf1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{load}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{load}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="A2.F6.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.21207v1/hidden_dim.png" id="A2.F6.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/301;" width="476" height="301" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F6.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="A2.F6.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Sensitivity to hidden dimension.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
