<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides detailed statistics for the datasets used in our experiments. Table <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ C.1. Dataset Details ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ Adaptive Graph Mixture of Residual Experts: Unsupervised Learning on Diverse Graphs with Heterogeneous Specialization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> summarizes the benchmarks for the unsupervised node classification task, while Table <a href="#A3.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ C.1. Dataset Details ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ Adaptive Graph Mixture of Residual Experts: Unsupervised Learning on Diverse Graphs with Heterogeneous Specialization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> details those used for the few-shot learning tasks.</p>
